{"name":"Nancy","hex":"#57b8dc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Nancy","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative letter-case form of nancy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Nancy"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nancy, France","blocks":[{"text":"Nancy is the prefecture of the northeastern French department of Meurthe-et-Moselle, located in the Grand Est region. The city is situated on the left bank of the Meurthe. The metropolitan area of Nancy had a population of 508,793 inhabitants as of 2021, making it the 16th-largest functional urban area in France and the largest in Lorraine. The population of the city of Nancy proper is 104,387 (2022)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Place_Stanislas_et_ses_grilles_%C3%A0_Nancy.jpg/330px-Place_Stanislas_et_ses_grilles_%C3%A0_Nancy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nancy%2C_France","wikidata":"Q40898"},{"title":"Arrondissement of Nancy","blocks":[{"text":"The arrondissement of Nancy is an arrondissement of France in the Meurthe-et-Moselle department in the Grand Est region. It has 196 communes. Its population is 427,697 (2021), and its area is 1,583.9 km2 (611.5 sq mi)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Locator_map_of_Arrondissement_Nancy_2024.png/330px-Locator_map_of_Arrondissement_Nancy_2024.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arrondissement_of_Nancy","wikidata":"Q701873"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Arc_Here_%285%29.jpg/500px-Arc_Here_%285%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Arc_Here_%285%29.jpg/1280px-Arc_Here_%285%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.o